### 15.8 Contact and ownership

This project is a personal artistic tool. There is no team, no release schedule, and no external users. All decisions are made by the project owner based on personal aesthetic goals and pragmatic development capacity. This document exists to maintain coherence across sessions and to interface with AI agents.

